{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50868","headline":"省题诗二十一首 寒雨滴空阶 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 寒雨滴空阶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霏霏飘永夜，滴滴落空阶。\n自有路歧恨，那堪离别怀。\n檐前声乍碎，枕畔梦全乖。\n远与岩泉杂，微将漏水谐。\n天涯思旧友，法上忆闲斋。\n坐到空庭晓，残云带石崖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}